Generates VocaDB links for the external links template.

== Parameters ==

{| class="wikitable"
! Parameter !! Description !! Example
|-
| <code>vocadb</code> || VocaDB ID number || <code>1355</code>
|-
| <code>vocadb2</code>, <code>vocadb3</code>, etc. || Additional VocaDB IDs || <code>2468</code>
|-
| <code>p = yes</code> || Link to Producer page instead of Song || 
|-
| <code>a = yes</code> || Link to Album page instead of Song || 
|-
| <code>vocadb = ok</code> || Hide VocaDB section entirely || 
|}

== Usage ==

```
{{T|Unofficial|vocadb=1355|_Y_=1}}
```
→ Links to song page

```
{{T|Unofficial|vocadb=1355|p=yes|_Y_=1}}
```
→ Links to producer page

```
{{T|Unofficial|vocadb=1355|a=yes|_Y_=1}}
```
→ Links to album page

```
{{T|Unofficial|vocadb=1355|vocadb2=2468|_Y_=1}}
```
→ Creates multiple links

```
{{T|Unofficial|vocadb=ok|_Y_=1}}
```
→ Hides VocaDB section

== Output ==

* **Song**: `[http://vocadb.net/S/1355 VocaDB]`
* **Producer**: `[http://vocadb.net/P/1355 VocaDB (Producer)]`  
* **Album**: `[http://vocadb.net/Al/1355 VocaDB (Album)]`